  "body": "### Describe the feature you'd like to request\n\nIt would be great if any users could see the Docker stats widget, even without administrator privileges. This could even be configurable.\n\nSimilar to the Download Client widget that works for any users, but only admins can interact with it.\n\n### Additional information\n\nI'm interested in implementing this myself if it makes sense for the project.",
